# DEBT-003 — AWS Artifact PDF binaries must NEVER be committed.
#
# AWS Artifact terms-of-use restrict redistribution of the PDF; the repo
# tracks only the SHA-256 hash in SHA256SUMS (the evidence-chain anchor).
# See specs/_compliance/aws-artifact-placeholder.md §4.1 for the full
# rationale.
#
# Ignore every file in this directory by default…
*
# …then re-allow only the SHA256SUMS ledger and this .gitignore itself.
!.gitignore
!SHA256SUMS
